From ce58ca63a83153aef5ed5f569f32aeddc848eca3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thaler Finance <noreply@thaler-finance.com>
Date: Thu, 16 Jul 2026 05:31:36 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: API wiring parity with production apps/web (47-op spec)

Ports the backend API wiring from Thaler-Finance apps/web at main 4e841e0b
into this repo, per the backend OpenAPI 0.0.2 surface (42 paths, 47 ops):

- src/lib/contracts + src/lib/sdk updated to the 4e841e0b snapshots
  (claim releasableNowGross/NetLamports, UserVaultStatRow.claimableNetSol,
  QuantVaultRow.venueMarginRatioPct; SDK F4 routing). Workspace imports
  rewritten to this repo's @/lib/contracts + @/lib/sdk convention.
- All /api/thaler/* BFF routes adopted from production (SDK-routed,
  withThalerClient envelope, quant + vault-stats + recovery + lifecycle).
- Hooks and claim components brought to parity (claim-yield-view 14-row
  fee-sliced model, Median APY portfolio stats); vault/[risk] page at
  production state (Projected APY removal included).
- Frontend-only surfaces preserved untouched: /portfolio route, /vaults
  redirect, og/vault-share card, manifest, not-found.
- Protocol icon assets synced; unused type imports dropped in
  sdk/resources/vault.ts under this repo's stricter tsconfig.

Checks: bun run typecheck clean (0 errors). bun run test: 114 pass, 2 fail
in allowlist-email.test.ts - pre-existing on Finance main with byte-identical
files (the 756dad3a allowlist trim was not reflected in the pinning test);
reproduced verbatim there. Code-level verification only; no venue or
on-chain behavior exercised.
